WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.633
Welcome to LitBlog.

2
00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:04.100
In under two minutes, you'll create an account,
join a class, and publish your first post.

3
00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:06.133
Choose Sign Up.

4
00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:11.300
Enter your name, school email,
a strong password, and choose Student.

5
00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.400
Confirm your password, then select Sign Up.

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.767
Open the verification email and select
Verify Email before you sign in.

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.367
After verification, choose Sign In.

8
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.233
Enter the same email and password
to open your Student Hub.

9
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.033
Select Join Class.

10
00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:32.633
Type the six-character code from your teacher,
then choose Join Class again.

11
00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.533
Open the class card to see announcements,
assignments, and posts.

12
00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:40.733
Select Create New Post.

13
00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:44.367
Add a clear title and write your response.

14
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.567
Select text and choose Bold.

15
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.733
Then choose a highlight color.

16
00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:52.500
The editor previews exactly what classmates
and teachers will see.

17
00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:56.267
Review your work, then select Publish.

18
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.100
Your post appears in the class feed with
bold and highlighting preserved.

19
00:01:00.633 --> 00:01:01.733
You're ready to write on LitBlog.
